.TH Y5-POLKIT-AGENT 1 "July 2026" "y5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
y5\-polkit\-agent \- polkit authentication agent for Y5 sessions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B y5\-polkit\-agent
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B y5\-polkit\-agent
is a graphical polkit authentication agent used inside Y5 compositor
sessions. It registers with
.BR polkitd (8)
and presents authentication dialogs when a privileged action requires
them.
.PP
It is normally started by the
.I y5\-polkit\-agent.service
systemd user unit as part of the graphical session, not manually.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR y5.compositor (1),
.BR polkitd (8)
